---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /media/
title: Media
excerpt: "Every picture from The Genesis Address in one place, with the episode or page each one comes from. Free to view and to download at full size."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{%- set library = collections.posts | mediaLibrary %}
<main class="gh-main gh-outer">
    <div class="gh-inner genesis-media">
        <section class="gh-pagehead">
            <h1 class="gh-pagehead-title">Media</h1>
        </section>

        <div class="genesis-media-intro">
            <p>Every picture from the serial, gathered from the episodes and pages where it appears. Each one names its post, so you can go back to the scene. Click a picture to see it full screen, or download it at full size. Like everything here, they are free.</p>
            <p>The pictures are made with AI tools, as the <a href="/frequently-asked-questions/">FAQ</a> explains. New ones arrive with every episode.</p>
            <p><a class="gh-btn genesis-signup-button" href="{{ site.subscribeUrl }}">Get new episodes by email</a></p>
        </div>

        <nav class="genesis-media-jump">
            {%- for section in library %}
            <a href="#{{ section.slug }}">{{ section.name }}</a>
            {%- endfor %}
        </nav>

        {%- for section in library %}
        <section class="genesis-media-section" id="{{ section.slug }}">
            <h2 class="genesis-media-heading">{{ section.name }}</h2>
            {%- if section.note %}
            <p class="genesis-media-note">{{ section.note }}</p>
            {%- endif %}
            {%- for group in section.groups %}
            {%- if group.title %}
            <h3 class="genesis-media-post"><a href="{{ group.url }}">{{ group.title }}</a></h3>
            {%- endif %}
            <div class="genesis-media-grid">
                {%- for item in group.items %}
                {%- set others = [] %}
                {%- for source in item.sources %}{% if source.url != group.url %}{% set others = (others.push(source), others) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
                <figure class="kg-card kg-image-card genesis-media-item">
                    <img class="kg-image" src="{{ item.src }}"{% if item.srcset %} srcset="{{ item.srcset }}" sizes="(min-width: 1100px) 340px, (min-width: 700px) 45vw, 92vw"{% endif %}{% if item.width %} width="{{ item.width }}" height="{{ item.height }}"{% endif %} alt="{{ item.alt or item.caption }}" loading="lazy">
                    <figcaption>
                        {%- if item.caption %}<span class="genesis-media-caption">{{ item.caption }}</span>{% endif %}
                        <span class="genesis-media-meta">
                            {%- if others.length %}{% if group.title %}Also in {% else %}From {% endif %}{% for source in others %}<a href="{{ source.url }}">{{ source.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}<br>{% endif -%}
                            <a href="{{ item.src }}" download>Download full size</a>
                        </span>
                    </figcaption>
                </figure>
                {%- endfor %}
            </div>
            {%- endfor %}
        </section>
        {%- endfor %}
    </div>
</main>
